<!-- VEE_LANDMARKS_MIGRATE_KEEP_THE_ICONS (design/RimMandrake/vee_port_plan_2026-10-22.md §1b, §2): the landmarks
     the planet carries, rebuilt as our own LandmarkDefs from the fields of Vanilla Exploration Expanded's defs.
     Each requires its ported RM_ mutator. Icon and namer fall back to vanilla Odyssey ones (VEE's textures and
     namer RulePacks leave with VEE; every landmark already stores its name and there is no worldgen); the Ash'karr
     icons come from AshkarrLandmarkArt's LandmarkIcons.xml. VEE_QuicksandPits maps to the existing RM_QuicksandPits
     (EnvironmentalHazards). chanceOnNonLandmarkTile stays 0 on every required mutator, so none of these is ever
     placed by worldgen. VEE optional chances whose mutator was not ported are dropped. RM_CraterLake requires vanilla
     Lake instead: the VEE_CraterLake mutator is on no planet tile (plan §1a lists the 58 used; its landmark is on
     one), so the mutator was not ported. -->
